# create2-deploy out dirs: one per (chain, deploymentId).
# The seal inside them IS committed, deliberately and explicitly, with `git add -f` (plan section 9).
# Test-owned scratch is named .out-test-* (a dir a coordinator writes) or .test-* (any other file).
.out
